:: CompanionLeaving [noreturn nobr] {"position":"2350,3125","size":"100,100"}
<<say>><<= setup.Mc.name()>>, wait, I don't feel well... This place is driving me crazy, I don't feel like myself.<</say>><br>
<<thought>>She nervously looks around, as if afraid the ghost might return at any moment.<</thought>><br>
<<say>>I'm sorry, but I can't stay with you. I have to get out of here, or I'll break...<</say>><br>
<<mc>>Yes, of course, I understand.<</mc>><br>
<br>
<<thought>><<= setup.Companion.name()>> leaves the house.<</thought>> <<if setup.Companion.sanity() lte 0>>
<<else>>@@.warningtext; Req. higher level of <<= setup.Companion.name()>> .@@
<</if>><br>
<<mc>>Well, I'm alone now...<</mc>><br>
<br>
<<run setup.Companion.resetHuntState()>>
@@.backbtn; [[Continue|$return]]@@<br>
<<done>>
	<<addclass ".linkselector" "disabled-link">>
<</done>>
